WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.215
Welcome to Planvisiq.

00:00:02.215 --> 00:00:05.565
Turn project data into clear results.

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:09.390
In this quick tour, you will go from a project

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.850
file to a report, or a presentation ready to share.

00:00:14.312 --> 00:00:19.967
Create an organisation, or find your company on the sign in page.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:27.927
Organisation is where you manage people, roles, user IDs and licence estimates.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:33.792
Accounts and payments are still previews, so use sample details.

00:00:35.105 --> 00:00:38.705
In the workspace, select New project.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:43.685
Enter the project and client, then choose a reporting date.

00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:48.645
Use the project selector to move between jobs.

00:00:48.645 --> 00:00:52.875
My project brings the selected job's results together.

00:00:54.252 --> 00:00:57.057
Open Files and upload Excel or CSV.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:04.327
Confirm the file type and column matches for each worksheet, then import.

00:01:04.327 --> 00:01:07.957
You can also attach supporting documents.

00:01:07.957 --> 00:01:14.172
These stay with the project, but their contents are not automatically read.

00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.340
Check the results after importing.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:23.520
Review missing values, conflicting dates and progress figures.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.900
Open a flagged record to correct it.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:32.595
Saving creates a new version, so earlier data stays available.

00:01:34.062 --> 00:01:38.602
Return to My project for progress charts and completed work.

00:01:38.602 --> 00:01:43.577
Change chart options, groupings or scope to focus the view.

00:01:43.577 --> 00:01:51.452
Under More tools, Activities lets you inspect and update the individual jobs behind the figures.

00:01:52.802 --> 00:01:58.302
In Reports, choose a progress update, weekly report or close out pack.

00:01:58.302 --> 00:02:04.502
Check the figures, customise the options and add your commentary.

00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:09.452
Save a draft or revision to keep a record of what you prepared.

00:02:10.867 --> 00:02:14.052
Open Slides and create a project deck.

00:02:14.052 --> 00:02:19.867
Edit text, charts and tables, add or reorder slides, and choose a theme.

00:02:19.867 --> 00:02:28.807
Add speaker notes, present from the app, or export an editable PowerPoint for your meeting.

00:02:30.178 --> 00:02:36.428
Open Assistant beside your work to explore progress and exceptions.

00:02:36.428 --> 00:02:40.478
Check its source links before using a suggestion.

00:02:40.478 --> 00:02:46.423
The current assistant uses local calculations and guided responses.

00:02:46.423 --> 00:02:49.988
Live AI is planned for the backend release.

00:02:51.283 --> 00:02:59.498
Export PDF for a finished report, PowerPoint for slides, or Excel and CSV for the figures.

00:02:59.498 --> 00:03:03.518
Settings holds branding and workspace backups.

00:03:03.518 --> 00:03:10.303
This version saves in your browser, so export a backup regularly.

00:03:10.303 --> 00:03:14.583
You're ready: upload, check, report and share.
